$* bracketPML / guard - a rollback mark around a bulk change.
$* 1. The mark goes first. Change the label to say what the change is.
MARKDB |bracketPML: before bulk change|
$* 2. Your change goes here, for example:
$*    =12345678/6304
$*    NAME /PMLC-CWBRAN-T1/01
$* 3. Check the result before saving: Q ATT, Q MEM, the 3D view.
$* 4. Fine  -> type SAVEWORK  (the mark is erased, no way back after it)
$*    Wrong -> type UNDODB    (everything under the mark is undone at once)
